T A-frame tower
# Legs at 45 degrees so the diagonal closes, all in one vertical plane. The top connector's hub
# points along x, which is what makes it a bearing for an axle later.
! base rail
C B1 W8 -2,-2,0.5 x y
C B2 W8 -2,0,0.5 x y
C B3 W8 -2,2,0.5 x y
R B1 B2
R B2 B3
! apex and legs
C T W8 -2,0,2.5 x y
R B2 T
R B1 T
R B3 T
